	"name": "Examples of Randomness",
	"title": "What chance may change",
	"lookup_name": "Randomness_Examples_of_Randomness",
	"description": "A recovered gallery of four original works: a Pollock-inspired floor painting, Monte Carlo sampling, bounded pipe growth and a cycling particle study. A stable floor and separate bays keep each process visible and reachable.",
